        <h1>Which AI Tools Are <em>Actually Worth Paying For?</em></h1>
        <p class="dek">A plain-English way for small and medium businesses to decide which AI subscriptions earn their keep. The real cost behind the sticker price, why most tools get wasted, and a simple test to keep or cancel any tool.</p>
